<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Speaker at Microsoft events"
	pubDate={new Date('April 09 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		I'm a passionate technologist and speaker who regularly presents at Microsoft conferences and
		events. My talks cover a wide range of topics including AI-powered development, cloud-native
		architectures, and modern web technologies.
	</p>

	<p>
		Over the years, I've had the privilege of sharing the stage at events like Microsoft Build,
		Microsoft Ignite, and various regional Microsoft developer meetups. I love breaking down complex
		technical concepts into practical, actionable insights that developers can apply right away.
	</p>

	<p>
		When I'm not on stage, I'm building with the latest tools and frameworks, contributing to
		open-source projects, and mentoring the next generation of developers. Feel free to reach out
		if you'd like me to speak at your event or collaborate on a project!
	</p>

